hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"801","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Jo, naujawan hote hue, buzurg shakhs ki us ki umar ki wajah se izzat kare, Allah Ta'ala us ke liye kisi ko muqarrar farmayega jo budhape mein us ki izzat karega."
"802","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo buzurg shakhs ki us ki umar ki wajah se izzat kare, Allah us ke liye kisi ko muqarrar farmayega jo budhape mein us ki izzat karega."
"803","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Abi Kaseer se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, woh ghar jo khushiyon se bhara ho yaqeenan naseehat o pand se bhara hota hai, aur har khushi ke baad yaqeenan gham aata hai."
"804","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar kisi bande ko Allah awam par haakim banaye aur woh un se khair-khwahi se kaam na le, Allah us par Jannat haram kar dega."
"805","[AI-translation] Hasan kehte hain ke Ubaidullah bin Ziyad ne Hazrat Ma'qil bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki us marz mein iyadat ki jis mein un ka inteqal hua tha, Ma'qil (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Beshak main tumhen ek aisi hadees sunata hun jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai, agar mujhe maloom hota ke abhi meri zindagi baqi hai to main tumhen woh hadees bayan na karta. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: Jis bande ko Allah Ta'ala awam ka haakim banaye (aur) woh apni maut ke din is halat mein mare ke apni awam ko dhoka dene wala ho to Allah Ta'ala us par Jannat haram kar deta hai. Use Imam Muslim ne bhi apni sanad ke sath us ki misl bayan kiya hai aur us mein (apni awam ko dhoka dene wala) ki jagah (aur woh dhoka dene wala hai) ke alfaz hain."
"806","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Malik al-Dar kehte hain ke Ziyad Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziyallahu anhu) ki iyadat karne un ke paas aaya to Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us se kaha: Ae Ziyad! Allah se darr kyunke haakimon ka shar tod-phod kar rakh dene wali cheez hai. Ziyad ne un se kaha: Tum to Ashab-e-Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein se ghatiya darje ke aadmi ho. Unhon ne kaha: Ashab-e-Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mein ghatiya darje ka aadmi koi na tha, ae Ziyad! Kya main tujhe ek aisi baat na bataun jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin (batao) lekin Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par jhoot na bandhna. Unhon ne kaha: Agar (bil-farz) main kisi aam aadmi par jhoot bandhne wala hota to bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par kabhi jhoot na bandhta. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo haakim raat dhoka dete hue guzare apni awam ko, Jannat ki khushbu o nasim us par haram hogi, agarche us ki khushbu sattar saal ki masafat se aati ho. Rawi kehta hai ke Ziyad ne un se kaha: Mujh se jo chahe mango. Unhon ne kaha: Main sirf tum se yeh mangta hun ke tum na mujhe nafa pohanchao aur na nuqsan; agar main beemar padun to meri iyadat ko na aao, aur agar main mar jaun to mere janaze mein hazir na ho. Rawi kehta hai ke sirf chand raatein guzri thin jab woh (Abdullah) faut ho gae. Ziyad ne logon ko un ke janaze ke gird bheed karte dekha. Unhon ne kaha: Yeh kaun hai? Logon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Mughaffal. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar unhon ne mujhe apne janaze mein hazir na hone ko na kaha hota, to main zaroor hazir hota."
"807","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein, mard ho us se bade ajar wala koi nahin jo haakim ke sath rehne wala nek wazeer ho, us ki baat mane, aur use Allah Ta'ala ki ita'at ka hukm de."
"808","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein, us shakhs se bade ajar wala koi nahin jo haakim ke sath rehne wala nek wazeer ho, us ki baat mane, aur use Allah Ta'ala ki ita'at ka hukm de."
"809","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har momin ka koi gunah hota hai jo woh waqtan-fa-waqtan karta hai; woh use nahin chhodta yahan tak ke duniya se rukhsat ho jata hai. Aur beshak, momin bahut bhoolne wala paida kiya gaya hai; jab use (tauba ke liye) yaad dilaya jata hai, woh yaad kar leta hai."
"810","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab bhi suraj tulu' hota hai, us ke do pahluon par do farishte hote hain jo kehte hain: Ae Allah! Kharch karne wale ko jald badal ata farma, aur rokne wale ke maal ko jald halak kar de."
"811","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bhooke bhediye jo bakriyon ke rewad mein chhod diye jayen woh itna nuqsan itni jaldi nahin pohanchate jitna maal o mansab ki mohabbat Musalman ke deen ko pohanchati hai."
"812","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bhooke bhediye, jo mazboot baade mein bakriyon ke rewad mein chhod diye jayen, woh itna nuqsan jaldi nahin pohanchate jitna maal o mansab ki mohabbat Musalman ke deen ko pohanchati hai."
"813","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bhooke bhediye jo bakriyon ke baade mein raat guzarein woh itna nuqsan nahin pohanchate jitna maal o mansab ki mohabbat Musalman ke deen ko pohanchati hai."
"814","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki aisi koi ibadat nahin ki gayi jo deen mein samajh se afzal ho."
"815","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sila-rahmi se badh kar koi cheez aisi nahin jis mein Allah ki ita'at ki jae aur us ka sawab jald mile, jabke baghawat aur sarkashi se badh kar koi amal aisa nahin jis mein Allah ki na-farmani ki jae aur us ki saza jald mile. Doosri hadees ki sanad yun hai: Apne walid se ek aadmi se Yahya se."
"816","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol deta hai, pas be-niyazi ikhtiyar karo."
"817","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa maal ko kam nahin karta, aur jab banda zulm o zyadati ko mu'af kar de, Allah sirf us ki izzat badhata hai; lehaza tum mu'af karo, Allah tumhari izzat badhayega. Aur jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol deta hai. Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Qasim bin Yazid Jarami aur Zakariya bin Dawood Ash'asi ne yeh hadees Sufyan Sauri se riwayat ki hai."
"818","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, teen cheezein hain jin par main yaqeenan qasam kha sakta hun: Maal sadqa dene se kam nahin hota, pas sadqa do. Aur jo kisi zulm ya zyadati ko Allah ki raza ke liye mu'af kar de, Allah us ki wajah se Roz-e-Qayamat us ka darja buland farmayega. Aur jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol deta hai."
"819","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen cheezein hain jin par main qasam khata hun: Maal sadqa dene se kam nahin hota, pas sadqa do. Aur jab banda kisi ke zulm o zyadati ko mu'af kar de, Allah us ki izzat badhata hai, pas doosron ko mu'af karo aur Allah tumhari izzat badhayega. Aur jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol deta hai. Suno! Bheek se rukne mein bhalayi hai. Kaha gaya hai: Yeh hadees Abu Salamah ki apne walid se riwayat mein nayaab hai."
"820","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek aadmi ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko gali di jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bhi tashreef farma thay, Aap ta'ajjub kar rahe thay aur muskura rahe thay jab us ne zyada badtameezi ki to Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us ki kisi baat ka jawab de diya, is par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) naraz ho kar uth khade hue Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) uth kar Aap ke paas gae aur arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Woh mujhe galiyan de raha tha jabke Aap bhi tashreef farma thay lekin jab main ne us ki kisi baat ka jawab diya to Aap naraz ho kar uth khade hue hain? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tere sath ek farishta tha jo use jawab de raha tha lekin jab tu ne use jawab diya to shaitan waqe' ho gaya pas main aisa nahin jo shaitan ke sath baithun. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Abu Bakr! Yeh cheezein sach hain, pas unhen seekh lo: Jis par zulm kiya gaya aur us ne darguzar kiya, Allah use badle mein quwwat o madad ata farmata hai. Aur jo sachchayi aur sila-rahmi ke taur par dene ka darwaza khole, Allah use badle mein zyada deta hai. Aur jo zyadati ki hirs se mangne ka darwaza khole, Allah, us ki wajah se, us ki tangi badha deta hai."
"821","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol deta hai. Agar koi shakhs rassi le, pahad (ya jungle) ki taraf jae, apni peeth par lakdiyon ka gaththa jama kare, phir (use bech kar) us mein se khae, yeh us ke liye logon se ghoom-ghoom kar mangne se behtar hai khwah woh use kuch dein ya na dein."
"822","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo apne oopar bheek ka darwaza khole, Allah us par faqr o mohtaji ka darwaza khol dega."
"823","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek sirf ya to ghafil kar dene wali maal-dari, ya faqeer bana dene wale faqr, ya tabah kar dene wali beemari, ya aql o hawas cheen lene wale budhape, ya achanak, tez maut, ya Dajjal (Maseeh Dajjal) ka muntazir hai. Pas Dajjal badtareen chhupa hua muntazar hai, ya Qayamat (Roz-e-Qayamat), kyunke Qayamat badi museebat aur zyada kadwi hai."
"824","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har ek sirf ya to ghafil kar dene wali maal-dari, ya bhula dene wale faqr, ya ghalib aane wale budhape, ya bigaad dene wali beemari, ya achanak, tez maut, ya Dajjal (Maseeh Dajjal) ka jo woh badtareen chhupa hua muntazar hai ya Qayamat (Roz-e-Qayamat) ka kyunke Qayamat badi museebat aur zyada kadwi hai ka muntazir hai."
"825","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ko jo bhi thakan, beemari, bukhar, tangi, ya gham pohanchta hai, hatta ke woh fikr jo use ghamgeen karti hai, Allah, us ki wajah se, us ke gunah bakhsh deta hai."
"826","[AI-translation] Hamzah bin Abdullah kehte hain ke hum mulk-e-Sham ki taraf bheek mangne nikle, aur jab hum Madinah aae, Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya tum Sham bheek mangne ja rahe ho? Halanke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Banda bheek mangta rehta hai yahan tak ke woh Allah se milega (Roz-e-Qayamat woh Allah se milega) is halat mein ke us ke chehre par gosht ka ek tukda bhi nahin hoga. Imam Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath marfoo'an bayan kiya hai: Tum mein se ek bheek mangta rehta hai yahan tak ke woh Allah se milega (Roz-e-Qayamat woh us se milega) is halat mein ke us ke chehre par gosht ka ek tukda bhi nahin hoga."
"827","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ek surakh se do martaba nahin dasa jata."
"828","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki. Imam Muslim ne use apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an bayan kiya hai: Momin ek surakh se do martaba nahin dasa jata."
"829","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo logon ka shukr ada nahin karta, woh Allah ka bhi shukr ada nahin karta."
"830","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon ka shukr ada nahin karta, woh Allah ka bhi shukr ada nahin karta."
"831","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... phir unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Sirf dua taqdeer ko taal sakti hai, aur sirf neki umar daraz kar sakti hai."
"832","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman al-Farsi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirf neki umar daraz kar sakti hai, aur sirf dua taqdeer ko taal sakti hai."
"833","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman al-Farsi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirf neki umar daraz kar sakti hai, aur sirf dua taqdeer ko taal sakti hai."
"834","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Burd-bari thokrein khane hi se aati hai aur hikmat o danayi tajurba-kari hi se milti hai. Rawi Sabuni ne apni hadees mein yun kaha: Hamein Abdullah bin Wahb ne khabar di mujhe Amr bin Haris ne khabar di."
"835","[AI-translation] Abul Abbas bin Qutaibah Asqalani kehte hain: Hamein Yazid bin Mohib Ramli ne apni sanad ke sath bayan kiya ke beshak Abus Samah Darraj ne yeh hadees bayan ki aur us ne matan ke aakhir tak muwafiqat ki. Abul Abbas bin Qutaibah ne kaha: Mujhe mere ba'z sathiyon ne kaha: Ke mujh (Mohib bin Yazid) ko Ahmad bin Hanbal ne kaha: Mulk-e-Sham mein tu ne kya likha hai? Main ne unhen kaha: Yeh hadees likhi hai, to unhon ne farmaya: Agar tu wahan is ke ilawa aur kuch bhi na likhta to bhi tera safar (zaya') na jata."
"836","[AI-translation] Haris kehte hain ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne apne bete Hasan (Raziyallahu anhu) se ba'z cheezon ke bare mein poocha aur kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jahalat se badi koi faqr nahin, aql se badh kar lautne wala koi maal nahin, khud-pasandi se zyada khaufnak koi tanhayi nahin, mashware se mazboot koi muzahira nahin, mansooba-bandi jaisi koi hikmat nahin, husn-e-khuluq jaisi koi khoobsurati nahin, gunah se rukne jaisi koi parhezgari nahin, ghaur o fikr jaisi koi ibadat nahin, aur sabr o haya jaisa koi iman nahin."
"837","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Mansooba-bandi jaisi koi hikmat nahin, gunah se rukne jaisi koi parhezgari nahin, aur husn-e-khuluq jaisi koi sharafat nahin."
"838","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jahalat se badi koi faqr nahin, aql se badh kar lautne wala koi maal nahin, gunah se rukne jaisi koi parhezgari nahin, aur ghaur o fikr jaisi koi ibadat nahin."
"839","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Munkadir apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baloghat ke baad (yatimi ka darja) nahin."
"840","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein daur-e-jahiliyat jaisa koi (naya) ehad ya mu'ahida nahin."
"841","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qais bin Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein (daur-e-jahiliyat jaisa) koi (naya) ehad ya mu'ahida nahin, aur jo daur-e-jahiliyat mein teh hua tha, use mazbooti se pakde raho."
"842","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein tark-e-duniya nahin. Abu Ja'far Tahawi ne kaha: Hum ne is bab mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak muttasil sanad ke sath is hadees ke siwa koi hadees nahin payi."
"843","[AI-translation] Ikrimah kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein tark-e-duniya nahin."
"844","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fatah (Makkah) ke baad koi (wajib) hijrat nahin, lekin jihad aur niyyat baqi hain. Aur jab tumhen jihad ke liye nikalne ko kaha jae, to nikal pado (baghair hichkichahat)."
"845","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke jab yeh aayat nazil hui: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaye (An-Nasr: 1), to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use padha yahan tak ke use (padhna) mukammal kiya, phir farmaya: Main ek taraf hun aur mere sahaba bhi ek taraf hain (jabke tamam baqi log doosri taraf hain). Fatah ke baad koi hijrat nahin."
"846","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fatah ke baad koi hijrat nahin, lekin jihad aur niyyat baqi hain, aur jab tumhen jihad ke liye nikalne ko kaha jae, to nikal pado."
"847","[AI-translation] Mansur ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath isi tarah bayan kiya hai."
"848","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis mein amanat nahin us mein iman nahin, aur jo wa'da poora nahin karta us mein deen nahin."
"849","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein khutba dete, Aap farmate: Jis mein amanat nahin us mein iman nahin, aur jis mein ehad nahin us mein deen nahin."
"850","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamein khutba dete, Aap farmate: Jis mein amanat nahin, us mein iman nahin."
"851","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Diyat sirf nazar ya dank se lagne wale zakhm ki wajah se wajib hoti hai."
"852","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen din se zyada talluq todna jaiz nahin."
"853","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bakhshish mangne ke sath koi kabeera gunah baqi nahin rehta, aur israr ke sath koi sagheera gunah baqi nahin rehta."
"854","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qarz ke gham ke siwa koi gham nahin, aur aankh ke dard ke siwa koi dard nahin. Harisi ki riwayat mein, Imam Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Ibn Abi Zi'b use Muhammad bin Munkadir se riwayat karte hain, aur Sahl bin Qareen use un se bayan karne mein munfarid hain."
"855","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran padhta hai us ke liye koi faqr nahin, aur us ke baghair, us ke liye koi ghina nahin."
"856","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Banu Khas'am ki ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hajv ki, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is baat ki ittela hui to Aap ko sakht ghussa aaya aur farmaya: Mera is se inteqam kaun lega? To us aurat ki qaum ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main (lunga). Woh aurat khajoorein becha karti thi, woh aadmi us ke paas aaya (aur kaha) in (khajooron) se umda khajoorein hain? Woh (umda khajoor lane) ghar mein dakhil hui, woh aadmi bhi us ke peeche hi dakhil ho gaya, us ne dayen-bayen dekha to use khane ki mez ke siwa kuch nazar na aaya to us ne wahi utha kar us ke sar par de mari aur us ka bheja bahar nikal diya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main use aap ki taraf se kafi ho gaya. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par do bakron ke sar bhi nahin takrayenge. Pas, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is jumle ko zarb-ul-masal bana diya."
"857","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Banu Khas'am ki ek aurat ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hajv ki, Aap ko is baat ki ittela hui to Aap ko sakht ghussa aaya, farmaya: Mera is se inteqam kaun lega? Us aurat ki qaum ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main is se aap ka inteqam lunga. Woh aurat khajoorein becha karti thi. Rawi kehta hai ke woh aadmi us ke paas aaya aur kehne laga: Kya tere paas khajoorein hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne use khajoorein dikhayen to us aadmi ne kaha: Main in se umda khajoorein chahta hun. Woh (khajoorein lane) ghar mein dakhil hui to yeh aadmi bhi us ke peeche hi dakhil ho gaya, us ne dayen-bayen dekha to use khane ki mez ke siwa kuch nazar na aaya, us ne wahi utha kar us ke sar par de mari hatta ke us ka bheja bahar nikal aaya. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main aap ko us se kafi ho gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phir farmaya: Is par do bakron ke sar bhi nahin takrayenge. Pas, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is jumle ko zarb-ul-masal bana diya."
"858","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Haris bin Fazl apne walid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Asma bint Marwan Banu Umayyah bin Zaid mein se thi, Yazid bin Zaid bin Hisn Khatmi us ka shauhar tha, woh Musalmanon ke khilaf (logon ko) bhadkaya karti thi unhen satati aur gustakhana she'r kaha karti thi. Umair bin Adi ne nazr man li ke agar Allah Ta'ala apne Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jang-e-Badr se sahih-salim wapas le aaya to woh (Umair) zaroor is aurat ko qatl kar dega. Rawi kehta hai ke (jab Aap jang-e-Badr se wapas aagae to) Umair ne (nazr poori karte hue) raat ke andhere mein us par hamla kar ke use maut ke ghat utar diya aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aamla, us ne Aap ke sath subah ki namaz padhi, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use ghaur se dekhte rahe jab Aap uth kar apne ghar jane lage to Umair bin Adi se kaha: Kya tum ne Asma ko qatl kiya? Us ne kaha: Haan. (Umair kehte hain) main ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Kya us ke qatl par mujh par kuch (khoon-baha ya gunah, waghairah) hai? Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par do bakre bhi seeng nahin marenge. Yeh jumla (muhawira) pehli martaba Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki pak zaban se suna gaya."
"859","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehtiyat taqdeer se nijat nahin dila sakti, aur dua us museebat ke liye nafa-mand hai jo nazil ho chuki aur jo abhi nazil nahin hui. Beshak, jab museebat nazil hoti hai, dua us ka muqabla karti hai, aur woh dono Roz-e-Qayamat tak ek doosre se kushti ladti hain."
"860","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehtiyat taqdeer se nijat nahin dila sakti, aur agar koi cheez rizq rok sakti hai to woh girya o zari hai jo use rok sakti hai aur beshak dua museebat se nafa deti hai. Bila-shuba Allah ne apni kitab mein farmaya hai: Sawae qaum-e-Yunus ke ke jab woh iman lae to hum ne ruswayi ka azab un se door kar diya. (Yani) jab unhon ne dua ki. Yeh lafz Ya'qub bin Ishaq rawi ke hain."
"861","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehtiyat taqdeer se nijat nahin dila sakti, aur dua us ke liye nafa-mand hai jo muqaddar ho chuka, aur beshak dua museebat ka muqabla karti hai, aur woh dono Roz-e-Qayamat tak ek doosre se kushti ladti hain."
"862","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehtiyat taqdeer se nijat nahin dila sakti, lekin dua us museebat ke liye nafa-mand hai jo nazil ho chuki aur jo abhi nazil nahin hui. Lehaza, ae Allah ke bando! Dua ko mazbooti se pakde raho."
"863","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin dhoke se qatl nahin karta."
"864","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh qaum kabhi kamyab nahin hogi jo aurat ko apna hukmaran banaye."
"865","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"866","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ke liye munasib nahin ke woh khud ko zaleel kare."
"867","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ke liye munasib nahin ke woh khud ko zaleel kare. Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Woh khud ko kaise zaleel kar sakta hai? Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh khud ko aisi aazmayish mein dale jise woh bardasht nahin kar sakta."
"868","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki. Aur ek doosri sanad ke sath, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sachche shakhs ke liye munasib nahin ke woh kasrat se la'nat kare. Imam Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai, aur us mein (as-siddiq ke bajae) lam ke sath li-siddiq hai."
"869","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do-chehre wale ke liye Allah ke nazdeek qabil-e-e'temad hona mumkin nahin."
"870","[AI-translation] Zuhri kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Be-basi o aajizi ka izhar sirf walidain aur adil haakim ke samne munasib hai."
"871","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki sirf khandani ya deen-dar shakhs ke sath munasib hai, jaise zuhd insan mein hi achchi khaslat hai."
"872","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Neki sirf khandani ya deen-dar shakhs ke sath munasib hai."
"873","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Khaliq ki na-farmani mein makhlooq ki ita'at nahin. (Us ki sanad) asl mein Hammad se Ibn Aun se Muhammad bin Sirin hai, jabke Al-Fawa'id mein Hammad se Ibn Sirin hai."
"874","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, koi shakhs Jannat mein dakhil nahin ho sakta agar us ka hamsaya us ke shar se mehfooz na ho."
"875","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Aap ne farmaya: Woh shakhs Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga jis ka hamsaya us ke shar se mehfooz na ho. Imam Muslim ne bhi Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh shakhs Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga jis ka hamsaya us ke shar se mehfooz na ho."
"876","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Chughal-khor Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga."
"877","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ke liye doosre Musalman ko darana jaiz nahin."
"878","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila kehte hain ke Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ne hamein bataya ke beshak woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raat mein safar kar rahe thay. Un mein se ek so gaya, pas ek shakhs ne us ki rassi li aur us ki taraf gaya aur use pakad liya, pas woh darr gaya. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye doosre Musalman ko darana jaiz nahin."
"879","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"880","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Sa'd apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi shakhs ke liye apne bhai se teen din se zyada talluq todna jaiz nahin."
"881","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ke liye apne bhai se teen din se zyada talluq todna jaiz nahin; jab woh milte hain, har ek doosre se munh mod leta hai, aur donon mein behtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare."
"882","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ke liye apne bhai se teen din se zyada talluq todna jaiz nahin."
"883","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke kisi Musalman ke liye apne bhai se teen din se zyada talluq todna jaiz nahin."
"884","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal-dar ke liye sadqa lena jaiz nahin, aur na taqatwar o tandrust ke liye."
"885","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal-dar ke liye sadqa lena jaiz nahin, aur na taqatwar o tandrust ke liye."
"886","[AI-translation] Abul Bakhtari kehte hain ke jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna us ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe thay: Log kabhi halak nahin honge yahan tak ke un ki na-farmani hadd se badh jae ya un ke paas koi uzr na rahe."
"887","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ka iman durust nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke us ka dil durust ho, aur us ka dil durust nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke us ki zaban durust ho."
"888","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, banda momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke woh apne bhai ke liye woh pasand kare jo woh apne liye pasand karta hai."
"889","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Banda momin nahin ho sakta yahan tak ke woh apne bhai ke liye woh pasand kare jo woh apne liye pasand karta hai."
"890","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Banda iman ki haqeeqat ko nahin pa sakta yahan tak ke use yaqeen ho jae ke jo use pohanch gaya woh us se tal nahin sakta tha, aur jo us se tal gaya woh use pohanch nahin sakta tha (kisi tarah)."
"891","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Banda iman ki haqeeqat ko mukammal nahin kar sakta yahan tak ke use yaqeen ho jae ke jo use pohanch gaya woh us se tal nahin sakta tha, aur jo us se tal gaya woh use pohanch nahin sakta tha (kisi tarah)."
"892","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda apne iman ko mukammal nahin kar sakta yahan tak ke us mein teen khaslatein hon: Tangi mein kharch karna, apne nafs se adl karna, aur salam khoob phailana."
"893","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi iman ki haqeeqat ko mukammal nahin kar sakta yahan tak ke woh apni zaban par qabu pa le."
"894","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah us par raham nahin farmata jo logon par raham nahin karta."
"895","[AI-translation] Abayah bin Rifa'ah kehte hain ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khabar mili ke Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mahal banaya hai, pas unhon ne unhen paigham bhejte hue kaha: Beshak, main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Momin apna pet nahin bharta jabke us ka hamsaya (bhooka) khane ke baghair ho."
"896","[AI-translation] Abayah bin Rifa'ah kehte hain ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko khabar mili ke Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mahal banaya hai, pas unhon ne unhen paigham bheja: Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate nahin suna? Aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"897","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aalim ilm se kabhi sair nahin hota yahan tak ke us ka anjam Jannat ho."
"898","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: (Duniya ke mu'amlat) sirf aur sakht honge, duniya barabar zawal-pazeer rahegi, logon mein bukhl sirf badhega, Qayamat badtareen logon par qayim hogi, aur Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) yaqeenan Mahdi hain."
"899","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Muhammad bin Khalid Jundi se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"900","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"901","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: (Duniya ke mu'amlat) sirf aur sakht honge, maal sirf badhega, aur Qayamat Allah ki makhlooq mein sab se bure logon par qayim hogi."
"902","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Qayamat sirf badtareen logon par qayim hogi."
"903","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Tum par jo daur aata hai woh us se pehle wale se badtar hoga. Hum ne yeh tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai."
"904","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qayim nahin hogi yahan tak ke mard kam aur auratein zyada ho jayen."
"905","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne duniya mein kisi bande ke uyub chhupae, Allah Roz-e-Qayamat us ke uyub chhupayega."
"906","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Ahmad bin Ibrahim bin Jami' se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"907","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne dost ke deen par hota hai, aur us ki suhbat mein koi khair nahin jo tumhare liye waisi khair na chahe jaisi tum us ke liye chahte ho."
"908","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar banda apni do mehboob cheezon (apni aankhon) se mehroom ho jae, phir sabr kare aur sawab ki ummeed rakhe, woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga."
"909","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu), jinhon ne sahabi hone ka sharaf paya, kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda muttaqiyon ke darje tak nahin pohanch sakta yahan tak ke woh un cheezon ko bhi chhod de jin mein koi harj nahin, mushtabah umoor se bachne ke liye."
"910","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Banda muttaqiyon ke darje tak nahin pohanch sakta yahan tak ke woh un cheezon ko bhi chhod de jin mein koi harj nahin, mushtabah umoor se bachne ke liye."
"911","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu), jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se hain, kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda muttaqiyon ke darje tak nahin pohanch sakta yahan tak ke woh un cheezon ko bhi chhod de jin mein koi harj nahin, mushtabah umoor se bachne ke liye."
"912","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu) se bhi ek doosri sanad ke sath isi tarah riwayat hai, aur us mein hai: Mushtabah umoor se bachne ke liye."
"913","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Meri ummat ka ek giroh hamesha haq par ghalib rahega yahan tak ke Allah ka faisla aa jae."
"914","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka ek giroh hamesha haq par ghalib rahega; un ki mukhalifat karne wale unhen kisi tarah nuqsan nahin pohancha saken ge, yahan tak ke Allah ka faisla aa jae."
"915","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Bande ki rooh us ke qarz ki wajah se mu'allaq rehti hai yahan tak ke us ki taraf se ada kar diya jae."
"916","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tak banda namaz ka intezar karta hai, woh halat-e-namaz mein rehta hai."
"917","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki tangi par khushi ka izhar na karo, aisa na ho ke Allah use aafiyat de aur tumhen aazmayish mein dal de."
"918","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"919","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wasilah bin Asqa' (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki pareshani par khushi ka izhar na karo, aisa na ho ke Allah us par raham kare aur tumhen aazmayish mein dal de."
"920","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zamane ko bura na kaho, kyunke Allah (zamane ka Khaliq) hai."
"921","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Ibn Adam mujhe takleef deta hai; woh zamane ko bura kehta hai, halanke main hi zamana hun (yani zamane ka Khaliq). Tamam ikhtiyar mere hath mein hai; main hi raat aur din ko pherta hun."
"922","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke woh Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath mulk-e-Sham ki taraf nikle. Woh kehte hain: Phir main ne Hazrat Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Haakim ko bura na kaho, kyunke woh us ki zameen par Allah ka saya hai."
"923","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho, kyunke woh pa chuke jo unhon ne aage bheja tha."
"924","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"925","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho, kyunke aisa kar ke tum zindon ko takleef doge."
"926","[AI-translation] Hasan se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ko apne bhai ka tohfa wapas nahin karna chahiye, aur agar woh (us ke paas kuch) pae, to use zaroor achcha badla dena chahiye."
"927","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apna hath us shakhs ke kapde par na ponchho jise tum ne kapda nahin pehnaya."
"928","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke koi shakhs apna hath us ke kapde par ponchhe jise us ne kapda nahin pehnaya."
"929","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Sa'il ko na laotao, agarche sirf khajoor ke ek tukde ke sath hi ho."
"930","[AI-translation] Amr bin Mu'az Ansari apni dadi Hazrat Hawwa (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat karte hain, woh kehti hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sa'il ko (khali hath) na laotao, agarche (khur de kar) hi ho."
"931","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"932","[AI-translation] Matloob bin Khattab se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sa'il ko (khali hath) na laotao, agarche sirf jala hua ghar hi ho."
"933","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Barzah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ki gheebat na karo, aur un ke uyub na talash karo."
"934","[AI-translation] Ibn Jabir kehte hain ke main ne Beirut mein ek buzurg ko suna jis ki kunyat Abu Amr thi. Mujhe yaqeen hai ke us ne mujhe Umm Darda se hadees bayan ki ke Harmalah naami ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, apni zaban ki taraf ishara karke kaha: Iman yahan hai, aur apne dil ki taraf ishara karke kaha: Nifaq yahan hai. (Phir kaha:) Main Allah ka bahut kam zikr karta hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Us ki zaban ko zikar karne wali aur us ke dil ko shukr karne wala bana de ... Aur unhon ne ek taweel hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi tha ke: Kisi ka aib kabhi zahir na karo."
"935","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Jari Hajimi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main ne kaha, Allah ke Rasul! Hum dehat ke log hain, hamein koi amal sikhayen, shayad us ke zariye Allah Ta'ala hamein nafa de. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi neki ke kaam ko kabhi haqeer na samjho."
"936","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai se aisa wa'da na karo jo tum tod doge."
"937","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi takleef ki wajah se jo use pohanchi ho kabhi maut ki tamanna na kare."
"938","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna, apne inteqal se teen din pehle: Khabardar! Tum mein se koi na mare magar is halat mein ke woh Allah se husn-e-zan rakhta ho."
"939","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek doosre se hasad na karo, aur khareedne ki niyyat ke baghair masnoo'i taur par qeematein na badhao, aur ek doosre se bughz na rakho, aur ek doosre se peeth na phero. Ae Allah ke bando! Ek doosre ke bhai ban jao."
"940","[AI-translation] Makhul kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aib talash karne wale, tareef karne wale, ta'na dene wale, aur amal mein susti dikhane wale na bano."
"941","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah Bahili (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi amal karne wale ke amal par us waqt tak ta'ajjub na karo jab tak tum yeh na dekh lo ke us ka khatma kis par ho raha hai."
"942","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi ke Islam ko achcha na samjho yahan tak ke tum jaan lo ke us ki samajh kitni gehri hai."
"943","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi ke Islam ko achcha na samjho yahan tak ke tum jaan lo ke us ke paas kitni samajh hai."
"944","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte thay: Mujhe sawar (musafir) ke pyale ki tarah na banao. Sahaba ne poocha: Sawar ka pyala kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, musafir apna saman apni sawari par rakhta hai, aur agar us ke pyale mein pani bach jae, woh use apni mashk mein wapas daal deta hai. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe apni guftagu ke aaghaz, darmiyan, aur aakhir (teenon jagah) mein rakho."
"945","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya, aur apne khutbe mein Aap ne farmaya: Logon ka darr tum mein se kisi ko haq baat kehne se kabhi na roke jab woh use janta ho."
"946","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Jabiyah ke muqam par logon ko khutba diya aur kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is tarah khade hue aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi mard kisi aurat ke sath tanhayi mein na ho, kyunke un mein teesra shaitan hai."
"947","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki narazgi mol le kar kisi ko razi karne ki kabhi koshish na karo; Allah ne tumhen jo ata farmaya hai us par kisi ki tareef na karo; aur Allah ne tumhen jo nahin diya us par kisi ko malamat na karo, kyunke kisi ka lalach tumhen Allah ka rizq nahin pohancha sakta, aur na kisi ki bad-khwahi use tum tak pohanchne se rok sakti hai. Sanad mein, Khalid bin Najeeh ka zikr is tarah hai, halanke haqeeqat mein yeh hadees Khalid bin Yazid al-Umari se Sufyan al-Sauri ki sanad se marwi hai."
"948","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imarat na mango, kyunke agar woh tumhen baghair mange di gayi to us par tumhari madad ki jayegi, aur agar tumhen mangne se di gayi to tum us ke supurd kar diye jaoge."
"949","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qayamat qayim nahin hogi yahan tak ke bachche ghusse o ghazab ka ba'is ban jayen, barish shadeed garmi ka ba'is ban jae, zaleel log khoob phail jayen, shareef ghussa hon, naujawan badon ko ghoorein, aur kamine shareefon ko ghoorein."
"950","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Musayyib kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi mashware ke baad kabhi halak nahin hota."
"951","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zalimo-nafarman awam wali qaum kabhi halak nahin hogi jab tak us ke hukmaran hidayat-yafta o rahnuma hon, aur agarche awam hidayat-yafta o rahnuma ho lekin hukmaran zalim o badkar hon, woh kabhi halak nahin honge."
"952","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Barah-e-karam mujhe ek hadees batayen aur mukhtasar rakhen taake main use yaad rakh sakun. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz aise padho goya tum rukhsat ho rahe ho (is duniya se), goya tum us ke baad phir namaz nahin padhoge. Aur jo logon ke paas hai us se na-ummeed ho jao, tum qana'at ki zindagi guzaroge. Aur us se bacho jis ke liye tumhen baad mein ma'zarat karni pade."
"953","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Had se badhi tareef se bacho, kyunke woh (zibah ki) tarah hai."
"954","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi ke sath bhalayi ka irada farmata hai, use deen ki samajh ata farmata hai. Aap ne farmaya: Had se badhi tareef se bacho, kyunke woh (zibah ki) tarah hai."
"955","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aishah! Un gunahon se bhi bacho jo mamuli samjhe jate hain, kyunke un ke liye bhi Allah ki taraf se ek mutaliba karne wala hai."
"956","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ki rae talab karne se bacho, kyunke woh uyub kholti hai aur khoobi dafan karti hai."
"957","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gandi jagahon mein ugne wale sabze se daro. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Gandi jagahon mein ugne wale sabze se kya murad hai? Aap ne farmaya: Khoobsurat aurat jo bure mahol mein pali ho."
"958","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Blawajah) qarz lene se bacho, kyunke woh raat mein gham aur din mein zillat ka ba'is hai."
"959","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badgumani se bacho, kyunke badgumani sab se bada jhoot hai."
"960","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazloom ki dua se daro, agarche woh kafir ho, kyunke us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi rukawat nahin."
"961","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z guftagu jadu hai, ba'z she'r hikmat hai, ba'z jumle bojh hain, aur ba'z ilm jahalat hai."
"962","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z she'r hikmat rakhte hain, aur beshak, ba'z guftagu jadu hai."
"963","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke do aadmi mashriq se aae aur khutba diya; logon ko un ki guftagu bahut pasand aayi. Pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z guftagu jadu hai. Ya: Beshak, ba'z fasahat jadu hai."
"964","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z she'r hikmat rakhte hain."
"965","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z she'r hikmat rakhte hain."
"966","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara' (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, ba'z she'r hikmat rakhte hain, aur beshak, ba'z guftagu jadu hai."
"967","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, meri ummat ek aisi ummat hai jis par raham kiya gaya hai (yani use khaas raham ata ki gayi hai)."
"968","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain: Beshak, yeh ummat ek aisi ummat hai jis par raham kiya gaya hai; us ke liye aakhirat mein koi azab nahin. Us ka azab duniya mein qatl, fitnon, aur zalzalon ki soorat mein bana diya gaya hai."
"969","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ek aisi ummat hai jis par raham kiya gaya hai; us ke liye aakhirat mein koi azab nahin. Us ka azab sirf duniya mein zalzalon aur qatl ki soorat mein hai."
"970","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Ishaq bin Khuzaimah kehte hain: Jab main Bukhara mein dakhil hua, meri pehli majlis wahan ke ameer Ismail bin Ahmad ke sath ehl-e-ilm ki ek jama'at mein hui. Wahan, kayi ahadees ka zikr aaya. Ameer Ismail ne yeh hadees: Meri ummat ummat-e-marhooma hai ... waghairah, is sanad se bayan ki: Mere walid ne hamein bayan kiya unhon ne Yazid bin Harun se Humaid se Anas se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... Main ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala ameer ki ta'eed farmaye, yeh hadees na Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan ki hai na Humaid ne aur na Yazid bin Harun ne. Ameer Ismail khamosh ho gaya, phir poochne laga: Woh kaise? Main ne jawab diya: Yeh hadees Hazrat Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se marwi hai aur unhi par us ka madar hai. Jab majlis barkhast hogayi to mujh se Abu Ali Salih bin Muhammad al-Baghdadi ne kaha: Abu Bakr! Allah tumhen khair se badla de, is ameer ne hamein yeh sanad kayi martaba sunayi hai, lekin hum mein se kisi mein us ki tardeed ki himmat na hui. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Balke, ameer Ismail bin Ahmad ka maqsad yeh hadees is sanad se bayan karna tha: Yazid bin Harun se al-Mas'udi se Sa'id bin Abi Burdah bin Abi Musa se un ke walid se un ke dada se ... Main kehta hun: Muhammad bin Bakr bin Fazl al-Faqih ki hadees, jo hum ne riwayat ki hai, us ki sanad Humaid se Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) par khatm hoti hai, aur yeh woh hadees hai jo hamare shaikh Muhammad Abd al-Ghani ne is kitab mein nikali hai jis mein unhon ne Bukhari o Muslim ki shart par Muhammad bin Bakr ki sahih riwayat jama ki hain, jabke Mas'udi ki hadees, hum ne use al-Bazzar ki sanad se riwayat kiya hai."
"971","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne ek hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Dosti nibhana iman ka hissa hai."
"972","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke ek budhiya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya karti thi. Aap us se khush hote aur us ki izzat karte. Main ne kaha: Mere maan-baap aap par qurban, jis tarah aap is budhiya se pesh aate hain, aap kisi aur se is tarah pesh nahin aate. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, yeh aurat Khadijah ke paas aaya karti thi. Kya tum nahin janti ke dosti nibhana iman ka hissa hai?"
"973","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, husn-e-zan achchi ibadat ka hissa hai."
"974","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, husn-e-zan achchi ibadat ka hissa hai."
"975","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, ulama ambiya ke waris hain."
"976","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, deen aasan hai, aur jo deen ko apne oopar bahut sakht kare, woh us par ghalib aa jayega. Pas sabit-qadam raho, miyana-rawi ikhtiyar karo, aur subah, shaam, aur raat ke ek hisse mein (ibadat mein) madad mango."
"977","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne ek hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Beshak, Allah ka deen seedha aur aasan hai."
"978","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, kisi neki ka sab se jald ajar sila-rahmi ke liye hai."
"979","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne ek hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Beshak, hikmat shareef aadmi ki sharafat badhati hai ..."
"980","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, jo halal ko haram thehraye woh us jaisa hai jo haram ko halal thehraye."
"981","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo halal ko haram thehraye woh us jaisa hai jo haram ko halal thehraye."
"982","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak, duniya walon ka nasab maal hai."
"983","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek taweel hadees mein farmaya: Beshak, haq wale ko bolne ka haq hai."
"984","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne kisi se ek mu'ayyan umar ka oont liya. Us ka malik tumhare paas use wapas mangne aaya, pas sahaba ne us se sakhti se baat ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, haq wale ko bolne ka haq hai. Phir tum ne use us ki umar wale se behtar oont diya aur us ka haq ada kiya, aur farmaya: Tum mein sab se behtar woh hai jo adayegi mein sab se behtar ho."
"985","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak woh beemar hue, pas un ke (deeni) bhaiyon mein se ba'z un ki iyadat ko aae. Unhon ne apni khadima se kaha: Khadima! Hamare bhaiyon ke liye jaldi kuch lao, agarche sirf roti ka ek tukda ho, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, aala akhlaq Jannat walon ke a'mal mein se hai."
"986","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hasan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, behtareen khoobsurati akhlaq ki khoobsurati hai. Sanad mein, pehle Hasan se murad Hasan bin Sahl hain, doosre se Ibn Dinar, teesre se Basri, aur chauthe se Hazrat Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) hain."
"987","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, kisi qaum ka aazad-kardah unhi mein shumar kiya jata hai."
"988","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, kisi qaum ka aazad-kardah unhi mein shumar kiya jata hai."
"989","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Jannat walon ki aksariyat saada-dil log honge."
"990","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Jannat walon ki aksariyat saada-dil log honge."
"991","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Jannat walon mein auratein bahut kam hongi."
"992","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, bande ki madad us ki zimmedari ke mutabiq aati hai, aur beshak, sabr bande ki museebat ke mutabiq aata hai."
"993","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, sab se badi neki yeh hai ke aadmi apne walid ke doston se talluq rakhe."
"994","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, sab se badi neki yeh hai ke aadmi apne walid ki maut ke baad us ke doston se achcha sulook kare. Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai: Beshak, sab se badi neki yeh hai ke aadmi apne walid ki maut ke baad us ke doston se talluq rakhe."
"995","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Shai ..."
"996","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, logon mein, Allah ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar woh hai jo logon ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar ho."
"997","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, logon mein Allah ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar woh hai jo logon ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar ho."
"998","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, logon mein Allah ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar woh hai jo logon ka sab se zyada shukr-guzar ho."
"999","[AI-translation] Mutarrif se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek ne unhen bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, is maal ka hasil karna aazmayish hai, aur use rokna bhi aazmayish hai."
"1000","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Burdah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main Ubaidullah bin Ziyad ke paas baitha tha jab Khawarij ke sar us ke paas ek ke baad ek lae ja rahe thay. Jab bhi us ke paas sar laya jata, main kehta: Jahannam ke liye. Woh kehte hain ke phir Hazrat Abdullah bin Yazid Hatmi (Raziyallahu anhu) ne baat ki: Ae bhatije! Kya tum nahin jante ke beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak, is ummat ka azab us ki duniya mein rakha gaya hai."
